  "text_elements": [
    {
      "text": "When the temperature in Li-ion battery pack is low with no necessity of Li-ion battery heater operation, LBC estimates the time that Li-ion battery may freeze and transmits a next start time signal to VCM via EV system CAN communication to prepare for starting the Li-ion battery heater next time.",
      "page_pdf": 26,
      "page_manual": "EVB-26",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        52.14,
        735.83589,
        558.5478599999999,
        703.6129228640885
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "HIGH_VOLTAGE"
    },
    {
      "text": "When receiving a next start time signal via EV system CAN communication, VCM transmits a start request signal (CHG-IGN) to LBC after a lapse of the set time. When receiving a start request signal (CHG-IGN), LBC activates the Li-ion battery heater.",
      "page_pdf": 26,
      "page_manual": "EVB-26",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        52.13885160000001,
        701.3371188000001,
        558.5687400000011,
        669.1130032640887
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "When EVSE is connected (normal charge)",
      "page_pdf": 26,
      "page_manual": "EVB-26",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        52.14,
        660.79129718,
        239.85023286390012,
        651.972693320464
      ],
      "type": "general_text",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "When the temperature in the battery pack is low outside the timer charge set time, VCM transmits a keep SOC request signal to LBC via EV system CAN communication. In this case Li-ion battery is not charged, and only Li-ion battery heater is activated.",
      "page_pdf": 26,
      "page_manual": "EVB-26",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        52.14,
        466.13587,
        558.5072483999994,
        433.9129028640884
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "HIGH_VOLTAGE"
    },
    {
      "text": "When timer charge starts at the set time, Li-ion batter is charged, and the Li-ion battery heater is activated.",
      "page_pdf": 26,
      "page_manual": "EVB-26",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        52.139999999999986,
        431.6359504,
        553.1576879999999,
        422.3923628640884
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "When EVSE is not connected (normal charge)",
      "page_pdf": 26,
      "page_manual": "EVB-26",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        52.14,
        414.07126718,
        256.55326923400014,
        405.2526633204641
      ],
      "type": "general_text",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "When the charge level of the Li-ion battery is low during the Li-ion battery heater operation, LBC stops the Li-ion battery heater operation even if the temperature in the battery pack is insufficient.",
      "page_pdf": 26,
      "page_manual": "EVB-26",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        52.14,
        219.41592000000003,
        558.5158091999998,
        198.65294086408835
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "HIGH_VOLTAGE"
    },
    {
      "text": "HARNESS LAYOUT",
